The solution also uses O(n) space for the arrays `leftMax` and `rightMax`, which is minimal for the given problem. The space complexity can be further reduced to O(1) by computing the maximum of the expressions directly in the previous iteration, without storing intermediate results. However, this would make the code more complex and less readable, so we kept the current solution for simplicity and clarity.

